    <!-- Dialogs & Bike Guide -->
    <string name="guide_title">Honda RoadSync Connection Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_message">Steps to pair H-Sync with RoadSync-equipped Honda motorcycles (PCX, ADV, Forza, Hornet, CB, Transalp, Rebel):\n\n1. Bluetooth Link\nConnect your phone to both your Honda motorcycle and your helmet intercom.\n\n2. Honda RoadSync Settings\nOpen the official RoadSync app and navigate to Settings → Music Source.\n\n3. Choose Music Source\n• H-Sync Bridge (BitChord / custom players): Enable the H-Sync Media Bridge switch, then select Spotify inside RoadSync.\n• Native players: Disable the H-Sync Media Bridge switch, then choose a native whitelisted player directly in RoadSync.\n\n4. Ride\nHandlebar switches control playback directly and track titles appear on the TFT display.</string>
    <string name="guide_btn_open">Open RoadSync</string>
